STATEMENT: >>>
How the system always behaves. It cannot be violated, only wrong -- a counterexample means the node is fixed.

Also: descriptive and universal only, the cell it kept when [LINK: DEC-NODE-FAMILIES] superseded the grid ruling. The mechanisms -- 129 on the sheet's day -- have never been tested one by one for whether they describe or impose. One MECH- node is a NARRATIVE now: the whiteboard this page carries as its last tab, filed as a mechanism for lack of the type and retyped in place under [LINK: DEC-UID-OUTLIVES-TYPE].

